
    Microtask Queue     Vs          Macrotask Queue ??

        Tasks in JS are executed from different queues.


    Feature                   Microtask Queue                                       Macrotask Queue

 -> Examples                Promise.then, queueMicrotask, MutationObserver          setTimeout, setInterval, I/O, DOM events.
 
 -> Priority                Higher Priority                                         Lower Priority

 -> Execution               Runs before next macrotask                              Runs after microtasks are cleared.

 -> Queue Type              One                                                     Multiple




    


    Call Stack      ->          Microtask Queue         ->          Macrotask Queue
        ⬆                                                                   ⬆
        ---------------------   Order of Execution  -------------------------